</td>
        <td class="NewsText" style="font-size: 15px"><a href="parrot">Parrot</a> is a Debian-based, security-oriented distribution featuring a collection of utilities designed for penetration testing, computer forensics, reverse engineering, hacking, privacy, anonymity and cryptography. The project's latest release, version 7.4, includes several changes, including a new onboarding tool: "<span class="Quote">A new tool has been added to our collection - Parrot Discovery is our first-run welcome application and full setup tool for your system. A guided checklist covers tool profiles, with selectable cards for everyday applications such as browsers, editors, chat apps, containers, gaming and privacy tools, all installed through curated APT and Flatpak commands that the user reviews and confirms. Package states are detected asynchronously, the system updater opens directly from the tour, next-step and tools cards close the flow, and autostart respects the stored preference while staying correctly disabled in live mode. Discovery provides a guided path from a fresh desktop to a working setup. Rocket receives a substantial update, not just packaging fixes. Its redesigned PySide6 interface combines a searchable tool catalog, image availability and running-container status with a Dockerfile manager: users now can create or generate Dockerfiles from catalog entries, edit and save them, build images and run the resulting containers from the same application.</span> Further information can be found in the <a href="https://parrotsec.org/blog/2026-10-03-parrot-7.4-release-notes">release notes</a>. <a href="https://parrotsec.org/download/">Download</a> (<a href="https://deb.parrot.sh/parrot/iso/7.4/signed-hashes.txt">MD5</a>, <a href="table.php?distribution=parrot&amp;pkglist=true&amp;version=7.4#pkglist">pkglist</a>): <a href="https://deb.parrot.sh/parrot/iso/7.4/Parrot-home-7.4_amd64.iso">Parrot-home-7.4_amd64.iso</a> (3,972MB, <a href="https://deb.parrot.sh/parrot/iso/7.4/Parrot-home-7.4_amd64.iso.torrent">torrent</a>), <a href="https://deb.parrot.sh/parrot/iso/7.4/Parrot-security-7.4_amd64.iso">Parrot-security-7.4_amd64.iso</a> (8,279MB, <a href="https://deb.parrot.sh/parrot/iso/7.4/Parrot-security-7.4_amd64.iso.torrent">torrent</a>).</td>
