        <td class="NewsText" style="font-size: 15px">The <a href="emmabuntus">Emmabuntüs</a> project has published a new update with a focus on improving accessibility options and features. "<span class="Quote">Our goal was to preserve the spirit of this approach: making accessibility features immediately available without requiring users to memorize numerous keyboard shortcuts. Easy Menu: one key for simple access to accessibility features: The Easy Menu provides quick access to Emmabuntüs' main accessibility features through a dedicated key: Right Control or F12. A simple press of this key opens a menu containing the main available functions. Users can therefore access the tools they need more easily, without having to remember a multitude of key combinations. This approach is particularly useful for people using the Orca screen reader, but it can also make computers easier to use for anyone who needs simplified access to assistive features. From the main menu, Easy Menu also provides direct access to certain frequently used functions through dedicated keys.</span>" Additional information and screenshots can be found in the <a href="https://emmabuntus.org/september-28-2026-emmade6-1-03-a-new-step-toward-more-accessible-computing/">release announcement</a>. <a href="https://emmabuntus.org/download/">Download</a> (<a href="https://emmabuntus.org/download/">SHA256</a>, <a href="table.php?distribution=emmabuntus&amp;pkglist=true&amp;version=de6-1.03#pkglist">pkglist</a>): <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/emmabuntus/files/Emmabuntus_DE6/Images/1.03/emmabuntus-de6-full-amd64-13.7-1.03.iso">emmabuntus-de6-full-amd64-13.7-1.03.iso</a> (4,359MB, <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/emmabuntus/files/Emmabuntus_DE6/Images/1.03/emmabuntus-de6-full-amd64-13.7-1.03.iso.torrent">torrent</a>), <a href="https://sourceforge.net/projects/emmabuntus/files/Emmabuntus_DE6/Images/1.03/emmabuntus-de6-core-amd64-13.7-1.03.iso">emmabuntus-de6-core-amd64-13.7-1.03.iso</a> (2,7